Princess Posse, and also an unofficial fan club, the Donut Holes. Donut also inspires the creation of the Society for the Eradication of Cocker Spaniels, a group formed based on Donut's hatred of Cocker Spaniels, which 
Carl and Donut used to crowdfund their spot as a full faction in the Faction Wars. Donut reveals to Carl that she overheard the conversation between him and B about B wanting to give her away and get a new cat for 
competitions. During the initial televised confrontation with B, she remains calm, but off-screen, she tells B how angry she is with her, even if she'll always love her, but that Carl is her person now. While Donut has 
many items and buffs, the most story important one is the Crown of the Sepsis [ __ ] When Donut equipped this item on floor one, it placed her within the line of succession for the Blood Sultanate on the ninth floor. 
