much as possible, but she is often censored from giving too much help by Born's rules or even the system AI. At one point, Zev was removed to a re-education camp and was replaced by Loyda, who was hostile to the Royal 
Court. Zev returns as a social media manager, but sounds stiff, formal, and robotic as if she's been brainwashed by Born. Eventually, Carl assassinates Loyda and although Zev continues to sound a bit robotic, Donut is 
able to figure out through a secret code that Zev is doing fine and is continuing to help them. Quasar Quasar is Carl's attorney. He gets assigned to Carl when he asks for a lawyer while negotiating with Orin over 
killing Loyda and the Gate of the Pharaoh Gods. Next up, we're going to talk about some crawlers our court interacts with. Let's start off with the Metalark team. First is Imani, who was a nurse for the Metalark Elder 
