father of Kadia's child. Juicebox is a dungeon NPC that has gained an awareness of her role in the dungeon. Carl and Donut helped Juicebox become the leader of an NPC team during faction wars. She's currently in the 
nothing. And yes, I know Juicebox is an NPC and not a crawler and we're in the crawler section, but give me a break, okay? She fits here. Lucia Mar. Lucia Mar is the youngest crawler in the dungeon, appearing to be a 
young teen. Initially accompanied by two Rottweilers, CC and Gustavo III, she's aggressive, dangerous, unpredictable, and wildly murderous, gaining several player killer skulls on the first floor. Eventually on floor 
six, Donut kills CC and Lucia shouts, she killed the wrong one. Through various interactions, the group speculates that Lucia is being controlled by Gustavo III and perhaps is a combination of multiple children inside 
